I am now at the fruit and vegetables.
I am looking for tomatoes and apples.
I see the tomatoes.
They are red and fresh.
The tomatoes go into the basket.
I also take apples.
Then I see another vegetable.
It is pale green and round.
On a small sign it says: Kohlrabi.
I do not know the vegetable.
The kohlrabi is not on my shopping list.
But I like vegetables.
I want to try something new.
So I buy the kohlrabi.
I put it into the basket too.
I do not need any more vegetables.
My basket is now full.
